        {
          "text": "Ariko bene Data, ikiruta vyose, ntimukarahire: ntimurahire ijuru, cank’ isi, cank’ iyindi ndahiro yose; arikw ijambo ryanyu ribe Ego, ego; Oya, oya; kugira ngo ntimucirwekw iteka.",
