        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaturanire ivyaha vyanyu, musengeranire, kugira ngo mukire indwara. Ugusaba kw’umugororotsi kugira ikimazi kuri vyinshi mu gikorwa cakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
